(7122053, 1088162, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great detail and character in the face. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I cannot see any outline of the neck or shoulders and find the "floating head" disturbing.</td>', 'Great detail and character in the face. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I cannot see any outline of the neck or shoulders and find the "floating head" disturbing.', '2013-10-26 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122054, 1088038, 43565, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. In my opinion, this only meets the challenge because of the title.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. In my opinion, this only meets the challenge because of the title.', '2013-10-26 19:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122056, 1088268, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and detail. However, in my opinion, it does not meet the challenge without the title.</td>', 'I like the colors and detail. However, in my opinion, it does not meet the challenge without the title.', '2013-10-26 19:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122058, 1088113, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were going for here, but it looks more like twigs to me. The white tanks(?) in the background do not add anything. The lighting is rather harsh, maybe try a different time of day to get softer shadows and more detail.</td>', 'Not sure what you were going for here, but it looks more like twigs to me. The white tanks(?) in the background do not add anything. The lighting is rather harsh, maybe try a different time of day to get softer shadows and more detail.', '2013-10-26 19:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122059, 1088215, 43565, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the light is too harsh and the shadows are distracting. The grass is over sharpened and so close to the color of the cross that the cross gets lost.</td>', 'In my opinion, the light is too harsh and the shadows are distracting. The grass is over sharpened and so close to the color of the cross that the cross gets lost.', '2013-10-26 19:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122060, 1088055, 43565, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, a larger DOF would help. The lighting is rather harsh on the right side of the photo, and the blown out area pulls my eye away from the subject.</td>', 'In my opinion, a larger DOF would help. The lighting is rather harsh on the right side of the photo, and the blown out area pulls my eye away from the subject.', '2013-10-26 19:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122061, 1088274, 43565, '<td valign="top">I find the tilt distracting. I looked at the trees to see if the ground is tilting or if it''s the shot. Some are straight and some are not, so I can''t answer the question! I would like to be able to see all of the ruins instead of so much foreground.</td>', 'I find the tilt distracting. I looked at the trees to see if the ground is tilting or if it''s the shot. Some are straight and some are not, so I can''t answer the question! I would like to be able to see all of the ruins instead of so much foreground.', '2013-10-26 19:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122062, 1088273, 43565, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in the fish. It does not say ancient to me without the title. I love white backgrounds, but in this case it leaves everything floating.</td>', 'Love the colors in the fish. It does not say ancient to me without the title. I love white backgrounds, but in this case it leaves everything floating.', '2013-10-26 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122063, 1087246, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a higher score if the feathers had not been cut off. I also find the change in background near the top distracting.</td>', 'I would have given this a higher score if the feathers had not been cut off. I also find the change in background near the top distracting.', '2013-10-26 19:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122064, 1087397, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more detail and the entire camera.</td>', 'I wish I could see more detail and the entire camera.', '2013-10-26 19:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122065, 1088213, 43565, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, a different angle or lighting would add interest.</td>', 'In my opinion, a different angle or lighting would add interest.', '2013-10-26 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122066, 1088228, 43565, '<td valign="top">This would be more interesting to me if there was more focus on the petroglyphs.</td>', 'This would be more interesting to me if there was more focus on the petroglyphs.', '2013-10-26 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122067, 1088175, 43565, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, I would not see this as ancient without the title.</td>', 'In my opinion, I would not see this as ancient without the title.', '2013-10-26 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122069, 1088114, 43565, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is not something I would consider ancient. The thumb and finger do not add anything to the photo. I like the idea of blocking the sun with the coin.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is not something I would consider ancient. The thumb and finger do not add anything to the photo. I like the idea of blocking the sun with the coin.', '2013-10-26 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122070, 1087577, 43565, '<td valign="top">Someone needs to buy some Comet. Not sure this is ancient...</td>', 'Someone needs to buy some Comet. Not sure this is ancient...', '2013-10-26 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122071, 1088095, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the background. I''m a little distracted by the bright colors.</td>', 'I like the texture of the background. I''m a little distracted by the bright colors.', '2013-10-26 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122072, 1087769, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle would work better if you want a silhouette. Otherwise, I would like to see more detail.</td>', 'I think a different angle would work better if you want a silhouette. Otherwise, I would like to see more detail.', '2013-10-26 19:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
