(7122910, 1088208, 108580, '<td valign="top">NG worthy.</td>', 'NG worthy.', '2013-10-28 17:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122917, 1087575, 97225, '<td valign="top">Not just superbly relevant but a beautiful work of art.</td>', 'Not just superbly relevant but a beautiful work of art.', '2013-10-28 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122918, 1087931, 97225, '<td valign="top">What brilliant juxtaposition!</td>', 'What brilliant juxtaposition!', '2013-10-28 18:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122932, 1088227, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love landscapes like this.  I struggle with what I see in your photo and that is the need to under-expose to give depth and rich color during sunset/sunrise and sacrifice visible features in the foreground.  It makes the photo look too much 2-dimensional.  This is a nice attempt to strike balance.</td>', 'I love landscapes like this.  I struggle with what I see in your photo and that is the need to under-expose to give depth and rich color during sunset/sunrise and sacrifice visible features in the foreground.  It makes the photo look too much 2-dimensional.  This is a nice attempt to strike balance.', '2013-10-28 20:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122934, 1087604, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  I am not wowed by some unique creativity based on perspective, lighting, etc., but it does capture the theme.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice concept.  I am not wowed by some unique creativity based on perspective, lighting, etc., but it does capture the theme.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 20:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122935, 1088274, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice imagery and perspective.  I appreciate the dramatic effect of using black and white.  The added texture brings additional dimension to the photo.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very nice imagery and perspective.  I appreciate the dramatic effect of using black and white.  The added texture brings additional dimension to the photo.  Nice work!', '2013-10-28 20:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122936, 1088132, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant, which is enhanced by use of black and white.  The graininess gives that impression of something old when it may not be.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Very simple and elegant, which is enhanced by use of black and white.  The graininess gives that impression of something old when it may not be.  Nice photo!', '2013-10-28 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122937, 1088158, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love the effects achieved by black and white. It enhances that aspect of age.  The fish-eye perspective adds a wonderful dimension.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'I love the effects achieved by black and white. It enhances that aspect of age.  The fish-eye perspective adds a wonderful dimension.  Very nice photo!', '2013-10-28 20:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122938, 1088083, 170281, '<td valign="top">Not excited about subject matter, but it sure emphasizes the theme.  Nice framing.</td>', 'Not excited about subject matter, but it sure emphasizes the theme.  Nice framing.', '2013-10-28 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122939, 1087350, 170281, '<td valign="top">I must be obtuse, because I missed the connection with the theme.  The shadow is interesting and the blurring keeps the shadow a focal point.  Not wowed, but I appreciate the creative effort.</td>', 'I must be obtuse, because I missed the connection with the theme.  The shadow is interesting and the blurring keeps the shadow a focal point.  Not wowed, but I appreciate the creative effort.', '2013-10-28 21:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122941, 1088113, 170281, '<td valign="top">I get the concept, but I think more could have been done with either perspective, lighting, shadows, coloring, etc.</td>', 'I get the concept, but I think more could have been done with either perspective, lighting, shadows, coloring, etc.', '2013-10-28 21:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122942, 1087888, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really like the viewing angle and coloring.  There is so much texture from the floor to the walls to the columns it provides so much to look at.  I think this photo would have looked exquisite in both the softness or more depth of field.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'I really like the viewing angle and coloring.  There is so much texture from the floor to the walls to the columns it provides so much to look at.  I think this photo would have looked exquisite in both the softness or more depth of field.  Very nice photo!', '2013-10-28 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122943, 1087575, 170281, '<td valign="top">You certainly captured ancient.  I am wondering what it would look like in black and white.  Nice framing.</td>', 'You certainly captured ancient.  I am wondering what it would look like in black and white.  Nice framing.', '2013-10-28 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122945, 1088252, 170281, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and I guess the reference to ancient is Santa versus the rocks and sea.  I think some additional depth in color and reduction in gamma lighting would make the photo more rich.</td>', 'Interesting photo and I guess the reference to ancient is Santa versus the rocks and sea.  I think some additional depth in color and reduction in gamma lighting would make the photo more rich.', '2013-10-28 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122948, 1088062, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The contrast of black and white gives an added sense of age.  I am wondering what a little more under-exposure (subjective) would bring out in detail on the statue and ivy leaves.  Good framing.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The contrast of black and white gives an added sense of age.  I am wondering what a little more under-exposure (subjective) would bring out in detail on the statue and ivy leaves.  Good framing.', '2013-10-28 21:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122949, 1088152, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the rich blue sky and redish-brown stone of the structure.  The framing and perspective is nicely done.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the rich blue sky and redish-brown stone of the structure.  The framing and perspective is nicely done.', '2013-10-28 21:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122951, 1088054, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love the content.  What do you think about more depth of field and black and white to bring out the multitude and intricacies of the roots?</td>', 'I love the content.  What do you think about more depth of field and black and white to bring out the multitude and intricacies of the roots?', '2013-10-28 21:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122952, 1087843, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice coloring and framing. Good eye for content.</td>', 'Very nice coloring and framing. Good eye for content.', '2013-10-28 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122956, 1088248, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love the subject.  Might be able to create a more dramatic impact with angle or cropping head and front leg.  Also, a little under-exposure might bring out more detail in the ridges and scales.  Nice work.</td>', 'I love the subject.  Might be able to create a more dramatic impact with angle or cropping head and front leg.  Also, a little under-exposure might bring out more detail in the ridges and scales.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 21:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122957, 1088124, 170281, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The clarity and framing is very good.  The sharpness of the eyes and cup edge, with softness away from those elements is a nice touch.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent!  The clarity and framing is very good.  The sharpness of the eyes and cup edge, with softness away from those elements is a nice touch.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 21:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122961, 1087957, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of focus, perspective, and lighting.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Nice combination of focus, perspective, and lighting.  Nice photo!', '2013-10-28 21:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122964, 1088134, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and use of black and white to emphasize age.  Good photo!</td>', 'Nice framing and use of black and white to emphasize age.  Good photo!', '2013-10-28 22:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122967, 1088175, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and nice use of under-exposure for added dramatic effect.  The graininess adds a nice texture.  Very good work!</td>', 'Very artistic and nice use of under-exposure for added dramatic effect.  The graininess adds a nice texture.  Very good work!', '2013-10-28 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122974, 1088201, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great subject and capture of expression.  There seems to be more clarity in the forehead lines and hair than the eyes.  I am not sure this was intentional, or a consequence of lighting, but a bit more definition in the eyes would be nice.  Good photo!</td>', 'Great subject and capture of expression.  There seems to be more clarity in the forehead lines and hair than the eyes.  I am not sure this was intentional, or a consequence of lighting, but a bit more definition in the eyes would be nice.  Good photo!', '2013-10-28 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122977, 1087765, 170281, '<td valign="top">I think what makes this photo is the perspective and lighting.  You were successful in taking a simple subject matter and making it a creative photo.  Nice work!</td>', 'I think what makes this photo is the perspective and lighting.  You were successful in taking a simple subject matter and making it a creative photo.  Nice work!', '2013-10-28 22:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122978, 1088136, 170281, '<td valign="top">Wow!  From the framing to the sun rays to the splash of green in the foreground, very nicely done.  Creative caption also.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow!  From the framing to the sun rays to the splash of green in the foreground, very nicely done.  Creative caption also.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 22:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122981, 1088186, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the simple elegance of the photo.  The softness looks like a lack of focus.  A sharper focus on the stone with softness on the band would be more dramatic.</td>', 'I like the simple elegance of the photo.  The softness looks like a lack of focus.  A sharper focus on the stone with softness on the band would be more dramatic.', '2013-10-28 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122984, 1088239, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and effects to enhance sense of age.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice perspective and effects to enhance sense of age.  Nice photo.', '2013-10-28 22:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122987, 1087987, 170281, '<td valign="top">Really like the lines, perspective and use of black and white.  Did you consider under-exposing a bit to bring out the lines more? Nice photo!</td>', 'Really like the lines, perspective and use of black and white.  Did you consider under-exposing a bit to bring out the lines more? Nice photo!', '2013-10-28 22:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122988, 1088263, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great eye for subject matter and love the use of black and white.  I am wondering what effect you would get by shifting the twisted area more left of right of photo center and changed the focus to the center of the spiral versus the front tip.  Good work.</td>', 'Great eye for subject matter and love the use of black and white.  I am wondering what effect you would get by shifting the twisted area more left of right of photo center and changed the focus to the center of the spiral versus the front tip.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122990, 1088160, 170281, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Great depth of color of sky and balance between gray-scale of structure and surrounding colors.  The framing and perspective is ideal.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Awesome!  Great depth of color of sky and balance between gray-scale of structure and surrounding colors.  The framing and perspective is ideal.  Very nice work.', '2013-10-28 22:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122991, 1087580, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and good eye on subject matter.  What do you think if you deepened the color to bring out more red and blue?  Good work!</td>', 'Nice framing and good eye on subject matter.  What do you think if you deepened the color to bring out more red and blue?  Good work!', '2013-10-28 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122993, 1087643, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white to enhance sense of old forest.  Framing and perspective are nice.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white to enhance sense of old forest.  Framing and perspective are nice.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 22:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122994, 1087771, 170281, '<td valign="top">Good eye on subject matter.  I am wondering if a bit of under-exposure would emphasize lines in cliffs a bit more.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good eye on subject matter.  I am wondering if a bit of under-exposure would emphasize lines in cliffs a bit more.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122995, 1088047, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light and perspective.  Set up is well done.</td>', 'Very nice use of light and perspective.  Set up is well done.', '2013-10-28 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122996, 1088207, 170281, '<td valign="top">Really well done!  Framing and perspective are very nice.  I am wondering if a bit more depth of field would add more definition to the person to equal the balance between the two comparative features of the photograph.  Nice work.</td>', 'Really well done!  Framing and perspective are very nice.  I am wondering if a bit more depth of field would add more definition to the person to equal the balance between the two comparative features of the photograph.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122998, 1088063, 170281, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of rule of thirds, focus lines and black and white.  Well framed.  I like it.</td>', 'Excellent use of rule of thirds, focus lines and black and white.  Well framed.  I like it.', '2013-10-28 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123000, 1088110, 170281, '<td valign="top">Creative and nice framing.</td>', 'Creative and nice framing.', '2013-10-28 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
