(7123007, 1088019, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and use of trunk line to move viewer to eye.  The entire photo has a softness. I would think greater definition around the eye would make the photo more dramatic.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice framing and use of trunk line to move viewer to eye.  The entire photo has a softness. I would think greater definition around the eye would make the photo more dramatic.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123009, 1088038, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and artistry.  It is amazing how simplicity creates more emotional response in a photo.  The use of black and white is great.  Terrific work.</td>', 'Nice framing and artistry.  It is amazing how simplicity creates more emotional response in a photo.  The use of black and white is great.  Terrific work.', '2013-10-28 23:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123010, 1087655, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  I think a bit more depth of field would bring out the lines without sacrificing the look of age.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice framing.  I think a bit more depth of field would bring out the lines without sacrificing the look of age.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123011, 1088107, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines and framing.  Black and white use really emphasizes the features of the church.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice lines and framing.  Black and white use really emphasizes the features of the church.  Nice work.', '2013-10-28 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123012, 1088148, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and it is perfect for black and white.  I wondering what effect shifting the perspective of the bridge to run a bit of angle across the photo would bring.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the subject and it is perfect for black and white.  I wondering what effect shifting the perspective of the bridge to run a bit of angle across the photo would bring.  Good work.', '2013-10-28 23:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
