(7123015, 1087970, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really love black and white and subject matter.  You have a good eye.  I am wondering what effect you could get if you shot from a lower angle so the moon was closer to the upper third of the photo?  Nice work!</td>', 'I really love black and white and subject matter.  You have a good eye.  I am wondering what effect you could get if you shot from a lower angle so the moon was closer to the upper third of the photo?  Nice work!', '2013-10-28 23:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7123017, 1088162, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and use of lighting.  Black and white is always a great format to bring out the lines and features of the face.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice framing and use of lighting.  Black and white is always a great format to bring out the lines and features of the face.  Nice photo.', '2013-10-28 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
