(7123422, 1087931, 113591, '<td valign="top">Should have come back to bump. Did get 8 though.<br/> <br/>You and John captured the past, present and future so well. Yours are scrambled on top of it, which is even better. The present oldness does not even have the strength or inclination to look at the virile past, and has turned her back on the uncertain future.</td>', 'Should have come back to bump. Did get 8 though. You and John captured the past, present and future so well. Yours are scrambled on top of it, which is even better. The present oldness does not even have the strength or inclination to look at the virile past, and has turned her back on the uncertain future.', '2013-10-30 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
