(7123684, 1088222, 150277, '<td valign="top">Such a perfect photo for the challenge.  I liked the texture and the border was perfect. I found the strong shadows a bit distracting, but still a neat shot. Thanks.</td>', 'Such a perfect photo for the challenge.  I liked the texture and the border was perfect. I found the strong shadows a bit distracting, but still a neat shot. Thanks.', '2013-10-30 19:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123687, 1087771, 150277, '<td valign="top">I loved this photo.  To me the small, relatively young tree, against the huge, very old, rock was fabulous for the challenge.  I also loved the bit of green against all that gray and the centering of the tree.</td>', 'I loved this photo.  To me the small, relatively young tree, against the huge, very old, rock was fabulous for the challenge.  I also loved the bit of green against all that gray and the centering of the tree.', '2013-10-30 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123689, 1088054, 150277, '<td valign="top">I was fascinated by this photo and thought it was beautiful.  Having slightly more color contrast between the green of the foliage and the brown of the tree might have made this ''pop'' a bit more.  Lovely though.</td>', 'I was fascinated by this photo and thought it was beautiful.  Having slightly more color contrast between the green of the foliage and the brown of the tree might have made this ''pop'' a bit more.  Lovely though.', '2013-10-30 19:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
